{
  "name": "Dimensional Shot",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You target an unoccupied space within 20 x your Proficiency ft that you can see instead of a creature. You shoot the projectile at the location and then teleport towards it. Any effect that prevents the projectile from reaching its destination also cuts short your teleport. In such a case you instead teleport to where the projectile was stopped or to the nearest unoccupied space of your choice.</p>",
